<title>USA: Irwin Financial Corp Q3 net down.</title>
<headline>Irwin Financial Corp Q3 net down.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ind. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.95		    $1.05</p>
<p> Net			  5,503		    6,039</p>
<p> Revs			49,875		   40,062</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,818		    5,759</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 net revenues include net interest income of $12.4 million vs $10.0 million a year ago, and noninterest income of $38.4 million vs $31.0 million.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 noninterest expense $40.7 million vs $30.7 million.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.67		    $2.58</p>
<p> Net			 15,519		   14,785</p>
<p> Revs		     143,540		  104,826</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,813		    5,732</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 net revenues include $35.5 million net interest income vs $26.6 million a year ago, and noninterest income of $110.8 million vs $80.4 million.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 noninterest expense $117.4 million vs $81.8 million.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
